e=\"top:28%;right:14%\">✦</span>\n            <span class=\"hero-sparkle\" style=\"top:62%;right:10%\">✦</span>\n            <span class=\"hero-sparkle\" style=\"bottom:22%;left:22%\">✦</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-container\">\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <p class=\"hero-pill\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-rocket\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                    India's Edutainment Platform\n                </p>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-tagline\">Learning ka Shortcut</h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-subhead\">Master pe sikho online business, government schemes, tech skills, spoken english, aur bahut kuch. Short videos mein asaan learning, bilkul aapke liye designed.</p>\n                <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.master.learn.ai&hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"play-badge play-badge--hero\">\n                    <span class=\"play-badge__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/images/playstore.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"play-badge__text\">\n                        <span class=\"play-badge__label\">GET IT ON</span>\n                        <span class=\"play-badge__name\">Google Play</span>\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"hero-stats\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Platform stats\">\n                    <div class=\"hero-stat\">\n                        <strong class=\"hero-stat__value\">10M+</strong>\n                        <span class=\"hero-stat__label\">Users</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-stat\">\n                        <strong class=\"hero-stat__value\">2000+</strong>\n                        <span class=\"hero-stat__label\">Video Lessons</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-stat\">\n                        <strong class=\"hero-stat__value\">20+</strong>\n                        <span class=\"hero-stat__label\">Categories</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- <div class=\"hero-visual\">\n                <div class=\"explore-categories\">\n                    <h4>Explore Categories</h4>\n                    <div class=\"category-icons\">\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"govt-jobs\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-building\"></i>\n                            <span>Govt Jobs</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"investment\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"></i>\n                            <span>Investment</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"business\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i>\n                            <span>Business</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"ai-learning\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-robot\"></i>\n                            <span>AI Learning</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"language-learning\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-language\"></i>\n                            <span>Language</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"become-creator\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-video\"></i>\n                            <span>Creator</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"category-icon\" data-category=\"digital-marketing\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-bullhorn\"></i>\n                            <span>Marketing</span>\n          